sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Corporate User
    participant Ingress as Ingress Controller (TLS)
    participant OpenWebUI as OpenWebUI Pod (tenant-acme)
    participant LDAPS as Corporate LDAPS (ldaps.acme.com)
    participant LiteLLM as LiteLLM Proxy Gateway (litellm)
    participant Redis as Redis Cache (Rate Limits)
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL (Spend & Key DB)
    participant Upstream as Upstream LLM (OpenAI/Anthropic)

    Note over User, LDAPS: Phase 1: Authentication
    User->>Ingress: HTTPS GET https://acme.ai.saas.com
    Ingress->>OpenWebUI: HTTP Forward (Host: acme.ai.saas.com)
    OpenWebUI-->>User: Present Login Screen (LDAP Enabled)
    User->>OpenWebUI: Submit Credentials (user@acme.com / password)
    OpenWebUI->>LDAPS: LDAPS Bind & Search (TCP 636 / TLS)
    LDAPS-->>OpenWebUI: Authentication Success (DN & Groups verified)
    OpenWebUI-->>User: Set Secure HTTP-Only Session Cookie

    Note over User, Upstream: Phase 2: Chat Inference & Governance
    User->>OpenWebUI: POST /api/chat/completions (Prompt: "Analyze quarterly results")
    OpenWebUI->>LiteLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer sk-tenant-acme<br/>Payload: {model: "gpt-4o", messages: [...]}
    
    LiteLLM->>Redis: Check Sliding Window Rate Limits (RPM / TPM)
    alt Rate Limit Exceeded
        Redis-->>LiteLLM: 429 Too Many Requests
        LiteLLM-->>OpenWebUI: HTTP 429 RateLimitExceeded
        OpenWebUI-->>User: Display Rate Limit Warning
    else Rate Limit OK
        LiteLLM->>Postgres: Verify Virtual Key: Is current_spend < max_budget?
        alt Budget Exceeded
            Postgres-->>LiteLLM: Spend ($502.10) >= Budget ($500.00)
            LiteLLM-->>OpenWebUI: HTTP 400/429 BudgetExceededError
            OpenWebUI-->>User: Display Organization Budget Depleted
        else Budget OK
            LiteLLM->>Upstream: HTTPS POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer <UPSTREAM_MASTER_KEY>
            Upstream-->>LiteLLM: Stream Tokens (Server-Sent Events)
            LiteLLM->>OpenWebUI: Stream Tokens to WebUI
            OpenWebUI-->>User: Render Streamed Markdown Response
            
            Note over LiteLLM, Postgres: Phase 3: Spend Accounting
            LiteLLM->>Postgres: Increment Spend (+ $0.0034) & Log Audit Record
        end
    end
